        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana S44R5N, 4\" x 4\" x 5/8\" Radius Residential Durable Steel  Hinge with Non-Removable Pin</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage includes a pair of hinges (2), matching steel flathead, Phillips Drive #10 x 1\" wood screws. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFitted with a high grade, non-removable steel pin. Non-removable (NRP) hinges are normally use on out-swing exterior doors for security. Utilizes zig-zag screw hole pattern for use with wood doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-S44R5N-specifications.gif?v=1704354697\" width=\"556\" height=\"275\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana S44R5N Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 4\" Non-Removable Pin Hinges:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Durable Steel</li>\r\n<li>Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: 5/8\" Radius</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.085\" (Residential)</li>\r\n<li>Standard Zig-Zag Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Non-Removable Security Hinge Pin</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #10 x 1\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/S44R5NRP.pdf?v=1691095374\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana S44R5NRP Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold in Pairs (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
