                "description": "Deltana S44R5NRP - 4 x 4 x 5/8 Radius Steel Hinge with non-removable pin.  Residential 0.085 thick. Package includes a pair of hinges, matching steel flathead, Phillips screws. Non-removable (NRP) hinges are normally use on out-swing exterior doors for security. Utilizes zig-zag screw hole pattern for use with wood doors.",
